      "procedure": "To 1.0 g add 20 mL carbon dioxide-free water, boil 1 min with continuous shaking, cool, filter. To 10 mL filtrate add 0.05 mL bromothymol blue solution R4. Not more than 0.05 mL of 0.1 M HCl or 0.1 M NaOH is required to change indicator color.",
      "kind": "specific",
